# Optional AppArmor profile extension for full ~/.config access
# Enable with: just enable-profile full-config-access
# Disable with: just disable-profile full-config-access
#
# WARNING: This allows Claude to read and modify ALL configuration files.
# This is dangerous and should only be used temporarily for specific tasks.

# Full access to all configuration directories
# Note: Some specific paths like .config/emacs/bin/ may have different rules in main profile
owner @HOME@/.config/ rw,
owner @HOME@/.config/** rwlkm,
